   "fadeOut": 0.35,
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 1.4,
   "text": "14 GB. AND A KERNEL DRIVER.",
   "y": -420,
   "fontSize": 60
  },
  {
   "text": "This Steam demo is\nfourteen gigabytes. For a\nside-scrolling action\ngame.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 4.774,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "And a hundred and sixty\nfive megabytes of it is\nvideo made for a phone.",
   "start": 5.024,
   "duration": 3.781,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "It's SlashZero, a 3D anime\naction roguelike. You're a\nTimehacker, and you\nrebuild your character\nevery run.",
   "start": 12.555,
   "duration": 7.308,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "The build ships two\nhundred and eight Bink\nvideos. One folder called\nPC, one called Mobile, the\nsame hundred and three\nfiles in each.",
   "start": 20.113,
   "duration": 8.483,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "It also carries two voice\nchat SDKs, one from\nByteDance and one from\nTencent, in a game with no\nvisible multiplayer.",
   "start": 28.846,
   "duration": 7.464,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "And a signed kernel-mode\ndriver.",
   "start": 36.56,
   "duration": 2.344,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  }
 ],
